   }
  },
  {
   "turn": 2,
   "response_text": "I can see a clear issue: the validation accuracy is consistently around 0.90, which is significantly **above** the healthy range of 0.8519\u20130.8607. The values range from 0.897 to 0.904, which is anomalous compared to the expected healthy range.\n\nLet me check the training logs to see if there are any errors or warnings:",
